{
  "uid": "kimkom-customer-overview",
  "title": "KimKom · Customer Overview",
  "description": "A clean operational view for managed customers. Empty selections are intentional when no clean inventory targets are present.",
  "tags": ["kimkom", "customers", "managed"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "client",
        "label": "Customer",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
        "query": "query_result(count by (client) (up{client!=\"\"}) or count by (client) (label_replace(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\",container_label_com_kimkom_client!=\"\"}, \"client\", \"$1\", \"container_label_com_kimkom_client\", \"(.+)\")))",
        "regex": "/client=\"([^\"]+)\"/",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Container environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
        "query": "label_values(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_kimkom_client=~\"$client\",container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\"}, container_label_com_kimkom_environment)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "hide": 2,
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
        "query": "label_values(node_uname_info{client=~\"$client\"}, instance)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "odoo_domain",
        "type": "query",
        "hide": 2,
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
        "query": "label_values(probe_success{job=\"blackbox-https\",client=~\"$client\",domain!=\"\"}, domain)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": { "text": "", "value": "" }
      },
      {
        "name": "glitchtip_base_url",
        "label": "GlitchTip base URL (optional)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "hide": 2,
        "query": "",
        "current": { "text": "", "value": "" }
      },
      {
        "name": "portainer_base_url",
        "label": "Portainer base URL (optional)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "hide": 2,
        "query": "",
        "current": { "text": "", "value": "" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    { "title": "Node exporter detail", "type": "dashboard", "uid": "kimkom-node-exporter", "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true, "targetBlank": true },
    { "title": "PostgreSQL detail", "type": "dashboard", "uid": "kimkom-postgresql", "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true, "targetBlank": true }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "row", "title": "01 · Service health", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 1 }, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Production HTTPS", "description": "Blackbox HTTPS probe success for the selected customer.", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "min(probe_success{job=\"blackbox-https\",client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "HTTPS" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "max": 1, "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Node availability", "description": "Exporter reachability; this is not application health.", "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "min(up{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "node" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "UNREACHABLE", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "AVAILABLE", "color": "green" } } }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "PostgreSQL availability", "description": "PostgreSQL exporter reachability for the selected customer.", "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "min(pg_up{job=\"client-postgres\",client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "postgres" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "UNAVAILABLE", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "AVAILABLE", "color": "green" } } }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Firing alerts", "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 1, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\",client=~\"$client\"}) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "alerts" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "row", "title": "02 · Backup confidence", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 5, "w": 24, "h": 1 }, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "stat", "title": "Last backup", "description": "Uses the backup-v2 exporter’s last-run result.", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 6, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "min(kimkom_backup_v2_backup_last_run_success{client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "backup" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "FAILED", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "SUCCESS", "color": "green" } } }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "stat", "title": "Last restore verification", "description": "A successful isolated restore verification, not merely a completed backup.", "gridPos": { "x": 6, "y": 6, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "min(kimkom_backup_v2_verify_last_run_success{client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "restore" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "FAILED", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "VERIFIED", "color": "green" } } }], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "stat", "title": "Backup age", "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 6, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "time() - max(kimkom_backup_v2_backup_last_success_timestamp_seconds{client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "age" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 5400 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10800 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "stat", "title": "Verification age", "gridPos": { "x": 18, "y": 6, "w": 6, "h": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "time() - max(kimkom_backup_v2_verify_last_success_timestamp_seconds{client=~\"$client\"})", "legendFormat": "age" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 2592000 }, { "color": "red", "value": 3024000 }] } } },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name" }
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "row", "title": "03 · Host resources", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 10, "w": 24, "h": 1 }, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "CPU · memory · swap", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 11, "w": 16, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "100 - avg by(instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\",mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100", "legendFormat": "CPU · {{instance}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "(1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\"}) * 100", "legendFormat": "Memory · {{instance}}" },
        { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "(1 - node_memory_SwapFree_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\"} / node_memory_SwapTotal_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\"}) * 100", "legendFormat": "Swap · {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100, "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "gauge", "title": "Root disk used", "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 11, "w": 8, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "100 * (1 - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\",mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"client-nodes\",client=~\"$client\",mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"})", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 70 }, { "color": "red", "value": 85 }] } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "row", "title": "04 · Managed development containers", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 19, "w": 24, "h": 1 }, "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 15, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Container CPU and memory", "description": "Only cAdvisor series marked managed=true are included.", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{job=\"cadvisor\",container_label_com_kimkom_client=~\"$client\",container_label_com_kimkom_environment=~\"$environment\",container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\",image!=\"\"}[5m]) * 100", "legendFormat": "CPU · {{name}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{job=\"cadvisor\",container_label_com_kimkom_client=~\"$client\",container_label_com_kimkom_environment=~\"$environment\",container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\",image!=\"\"}", "legendFormat": "Memory · {{name}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 16, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Container restarts and OOM events", "description": "Changes over the selected time window; zero is healthy, missing data means no series was exported.", "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "changes(container_start_time_seconds{job=\"cadvisor\",container_label_com_kimkom_client=~\"$client\",container_label_com_kimkom_environment=~\"$environment\",container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\",image!=\"\"}[6h])", "legendFormat": "Restarts · {{name}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" }, "expr": "increase(container_oom_events_total{job=\"cadvisor\",container_label_com_kimkom_client=~\"$client\",container_label_com_kimkom_environment=~\"$environment\",container_label_com_kimkom_managed=\"true\",image!=\"\"}[6h])", "legendFormat": "OOM · {{name}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 17, "type": "text", "title": "Customer tools", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 28, "w": 24, "h": 5 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "## Selected customer\n\n**Odoo** · [Open production domain](https://${odoo_domain})  \n**GlitchTip** · [Open project issues](${glitchtip_base_url}/organizations/kimkom/projects/${client}/issues/)  \n**Portainer** · [Open Portainer](${portainer_base_url}/#!/home) *(generic management console; not automated by this dashboard)*\n\n[Node exporter detail](/d/kimkom-node-exporter?var-instance=${instance}) · [PostgreSQL detail](/d/kimkom-postgresql?var-instance=${instance})\n\n> Optional tool URLs are dashboard variables, so this view does not publish internal deployment addresses or credentials. Empty links are expected until an operator supplies the approved base URL.\n\n**No clean inventory targets?** Select a customer above when Prometheus has stable `client` labels. An empty panel is expected and does not imply an outage.\n" }
    }
  ]
}
